  - line: 12
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: Three weeks after the uprising, Geralt recovers and explores deep subterranean tunnels guided by the sound of trickling water, discovering a portal-like pond that exists adjacent to normal reality."
  - line: 13
    type: narration
